<title>FRANCE: Euro Disney chairman quits to head Club Med.</title>
<headline>Euro Disney chairman quits to head Club Med.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-02-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Euro Disney said on Friday chairman Philippe Bourguignon would leave in the next few days to go to Club Mediterranee.</p>
<p>He will be succeeded by Euro Disney president and chief operating officer Gilles Pelisson, a spokesman said.</p>
<p>A source at Club Med confirmed that Bourguignon would be appointed chairman of the resort company, replacing Serge Trigano.</p>
</text>
